# Installed as a snippet inside
# /etc/apparmor.d/local/abstractions/libvirt-qemu, which the stock abstraction
# includes, so every domain profile gets these.
#
# The emulator has to be readable and executable by the confined domain, and
# its own share/ has to be readable — this build installs no firmware blobs
# (Ubuntu's source ships none) and is pointed at the distro's copies instead,
# but keymaps and the like still live under the prefix.
/usr/lib/starling/qemu/bin/qemu-system-x86_64 rmix,
/usr/lib/starling/qemu/share/** r,
